{{Term/Store|''Ivee's Diary''||Series, BotW}},<ref>{{Cite|Ivee's Diary|Game Screen|BotW}}</ref> also known as '''''Ivee's Recipe Book''''',<ref>{{Cite|Ivee's Recipe Book|Ivee's Diary|BotW}}</ref> is an [[Object]] in {{BotW}}.

==Location and Uses==
''Ivee's Diary'' is a [[Book]] found on the table beside [[Ivee]]'s [[Bed]], located in the upper part of the [[East Wind]] in [[Hateno Village]]. It contains the recipes for three different meals, those being [[Mushroom Risotto]], [[Poultry Pilaf]], and [[Egg Pudding]].

